2. **Workflow Parameter Issues** ✅
   - KSampler parameter validation errors
   - Incorrect parameter order in workflow JSON
   - Required manual fixes in ComfyUI interface

3. **Generation Problems** ✅
   - Duplicate subjects in images
   - Wrong backgrounds (daylight instead of night)
   - Missing subjects (empty rooms)
   - Inconsistent results despite prompt refinements

4. **Integration Complexity** ✅
   - ComfyUI workflow system too complex for project needs
   - Time investment not justified by results
   - Better alternatives available for character image generation

